{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n いつものように車に乗って外の景色を見ていたら\n 隣を走っていたトラックがドアを運んでいました。\n \n そのまま立てて乗せていたので\n どこでもドアみたいだったよ🚪\n \n どこでもドア、、、、、、、、欲しいなあ\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n 頂いたのに\n ずっと載せられなかった\n お花を載せて行きます🌷\n \n 1月20日\n 大阪での全国握手会\n 丹生ちゃんとペアでした！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7Q59M28SEXXNZNF2HGS0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n その時に頂いたお花です。\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7R4E17QF2V8KYPHC2NMJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7S4EJ0CFRB16WDB5AM0M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 誕生日お祝いのお花が沢山！\n 嬉しかったです😳\n \n \n \n その次の日は\n 幕張で全国握手会！\n パリピース\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7T62FT6SY9X31PVTGZQF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7VBA1R8N1FDKA2JNMRTM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7WAKSAY4BG8JK2W2TK1V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7XEMJE9DYQ049PTMBCB4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7YDTX564W1ZPTQENVV3H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R7ZE4C0E2RN9DKA4GYY95","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n お誕生日が近かったこともあり、\n わたしの大好きな青系なお花が沢山！！\n ありがとうございました。\n \n ストームトルーパーが付いていた！\n かわいい嬉しい🧚‍♀️\n \n \n \n \n 本当に本当にありがとうございます。\n \n この間の個握の時の写真、\n また次のブログに載せます！\n \n \n \n 最後に武道館の思い出\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1R80EKD26JY0D0X6HKS0T4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n めいめいが大好きなひなこ（河田陽菜）と\n 同じ椅子に座ったら\n 怒りながらもめいめいが写真を撮ってくれたよ。\n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}